  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 528ecde27feefd74eb359b784c14f552, type: 3}
  m_Name: Maria
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DollConfig
  dollName: Maria
  dollOwner: Claire Green, 11 y.o., female, alive
  dollStory: "Maria was considered an ordinary doll, until Claire noticed something
    strange\u2014whenever she blinked, the doll would disappear. Eventually, the
    doll was found near the Green family residence, carefully placed in a basket,
    almost as if it were a baby. Assuming the doll was simply a gift from a neighbor,
    the family decided to bring it inside."
  dollReason: "Maria harbors a spirit that allows her to move at completely unnatural
    speeds. In the blink of an eye, the doll will shift positions, but this seems
    to be her only act. No reports have indicated that the doll has caused any harm,
    for this, the doll's marked as neutral. However, every spirit that does not show
    human empathy still should be destroyed. It was later discovered that the person
    who left Maria in front of the Green household, placed gently in a basket, was
    none other than Claire's grandmother\u2014acting with no ill intentions."
